Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.65,0:03:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's sweating so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.91,0:03:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll dehydrate soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.01,0:03:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if we can get him to log out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.41,0:03:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or at least warn him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.01,0:03:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he wouldn't hear us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.35,0:03:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dive blocks everything out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.77,0:03:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Amu Sphere is designed\Nwith stuff like this in mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.49,0:03:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it should shut off if\Nhe gets too dehydrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.21,0:03:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.29,0:03:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we just have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.71,0:03:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mommy.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:39.30,0:03:45.64,Phone,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\frz339.5\fscx42\fscy42\pos(1232.4,317)\c&HCBB9CF&}Yui
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.30,0:03:45.64,Phone,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\frz339.5\fscx42\fscy42\pos(1233.9,318.5)\c&H6AA885&}Yui
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.30,0:03:45.64,Phone,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\frz339.5\fscx42\fscy42\pos(1230.9,314)\c&H6640BB&}Yui
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.62,0:03:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try holding Daddy's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.79,0:03:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll feel the warmth of your touch\Nand know you're here watching over him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.15,0:03:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since I can't touch anything in\Nyour world, hold it for me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.95,0:03:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know he won't feel me there, but still.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.59,0:03:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.03,0:03:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'll feel your hand, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.77,0:03:57.90,Phone,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\frz283\fax-0.19\fscx29\fscy29\pos(239,590.51)}Yui
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.90,0:03:58.02,Phone,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\fscx29\fscy29\pos(570.55,561.79)\frz296\fax-0.38}Yui
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.02,0:03:58.15,Phone,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\frz294\fax-0.31\fscx29\fscy29\pos(841.38,533.45)}Yui
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.65,0:03:58.78,Phone,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\frz294\fax-0.31\fscx29\fscy29\pos(1104.75,497.25)\clip(m 1089 463.5 l 1095 489 1116 510 1161 496.5)}Yui
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.78,0:03:59.48,Phone,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\frz294\fax-0.31\fscx29\fscy29\pos(1104.75,497.25)}Yui
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.67,0:04:00.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know he will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.45,0:04:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll cheer him on, together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.47,0:04:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.23,0:04:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.15,0:04:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight for what you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.07,0:04:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll be right here by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.29,0:04:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wherever you go, and whatever\Nyou do, I'll always be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.07,0:04:20.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.23,0:04:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to know his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.41,0:04:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't want anything to do with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.37,0:04:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.95,0:04:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be rid of him that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.99,0:04:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.29,0:04:36.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only pretended to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.71,0:04:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I was just fooling myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.37,0:04:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Red eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.11,0:05:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw them in the\Nbriefing before the raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.61,0:05:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.81,0:05:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Red.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.27,0:05:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Red.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.63,0:05:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zaza!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.07,0:05:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Red-Eyed Zaza! That's\Nyou! That's your name!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.81,0:05:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kidicho!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.69,0:05:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Xenon's distracting him\Nwith her bullet line!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.39,0:05:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's got him in her sights,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.11,0:06:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,using all her skill and spirit\Nto keep it trained on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.51,0:06:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a phantom bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.57,0:06:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One last attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.71,0:06:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't waste this chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.85,0:06:57.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.87,0:07:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.87,0:07:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.89,0:07:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.39,0:07:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.67,0:07:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Zaza.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.33,0:07:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.51,0:07:38.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we'll find your partner too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.87,0:07:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't kill anyone anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.93,0:07:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Laughing Coffin's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.97,0:07:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.79,0:07:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.77,0:08:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.33,0:08:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.07,0:08:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess now, we should probably\Nget this tourney over with, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.37,0:08:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we should.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.79,0:08:47.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With Death Gun out of the picture,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.75,0:08:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure the guy casing\Nout your apartment's taken off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.81,0:08:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think you'll be in\Nany danger when you log out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.99,0:08:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you should call the cops\Nwhen you do, just to be safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.17,0:09:03.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but what am I supposed to tell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.77,0:09:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.11,0:09:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guy I work for is with the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.31,0:09:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could ask him to send\Nthe cops to your place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.65,0:09:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how am I going to get your info?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.35,0:09:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't really ask for it in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.59,0:09:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cool. I'll tell you. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.13,0:09:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.93,0:09:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Shino.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.67,0:09:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shino Asada.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.13,0:09:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.29,0:09:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not going to believe this, but\Nyou're close to the place I'm diving from.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.55,0:09:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.46,0:09:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.81,0:09:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.89,0:09:42.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After we log out, I could head\Nover to you. You would? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.65,0:09:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.21,0:09:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A friend of mine lives near me,\Nso I've got help if I need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.77,0:09:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.68,0:09:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but after I log out, I'll call the guy\NI work for and have him send the cops,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.29,0:09:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you're cool with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.27,0:09:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.75,0:09:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.33,0:10:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just gonna log out\Nwithout telling me your info?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.19,0:10:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.79,0:10:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My real name is Kazuto Kirigaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.41,0:10:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how you got Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.97,0:10:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.88,0:10:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about a lack of imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.85,0:10:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, like you're one to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.93,0:10:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.29,0:10:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we're ever going to log out of\Nthis thing, we've got to end B .O .B.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.75,0:10:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.89,0:10:30.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, how do you want to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.01,0:10:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to have a duel\Nlike we did yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.01,0:10:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.75,0:10:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.93,0:10:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all banged up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.49,0:10:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no challenge in beating someone\Nwho's already as thrashed as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.51,0:10:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'll take you on at the next B.O.B.,\Nbut you better not leave me hanging.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.01,0:10:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.49,0:10:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's get this\Nthing over with already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.11,0:10:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are we going to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.99,0:10:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless one of our HPs drains out all the\Nway, there's not going to be a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.11,0:11:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you didn't hear what\Nhappened in the first POB.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.03,0:11:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There were two winners.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.35,0:11:05.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The player who should have won\Nlet his guard down too soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.25,0:11:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so his opponent gave him what\Nwe call a souvenir grenade.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.93,0:11:10.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A souvenir grenade?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.69,0:11:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The heck's that? This.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.29,0:11:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.97,0:11:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,OK. Adelante! Kishe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.73,0:11:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ha, ha,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.45,0:11:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ha.
