Dialogue: 2,0:12:14.73,0:12:14.98,Android,,0,0,0,,{\an6\blur1.35\frz351\fs330\fry-1\fax0.18\c&H2F2F2F&\alpha&H10&\pos(1783.5,441)}2 Seconds Left
Dialogue: 2,0:12:14.98,0:12:15.98,Android,,0,0,0,,{\an6\blur1.35\frz351\fs330\fry-1\fax0.18\c&H2F2F2F&\alpha&H10&\pos(1783.5,441)}1 Second{\fscx173.6}\h{\fscx100} Left
Dialogue: 2,0:12:15.98,0:12:16.94,Android,,0,0,0,,{\an6\blur1.35\frz351\fs330\fry-1\fax0.18\c&H2F2F2F&\alpha&H10&\pos(1783.5,441)}0 Seconds Left
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.47,0:12:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.13,0:13:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.93,0:13:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asura, you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.81,0:13:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me, Asura.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.43,0:13:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shinkawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.35,0:13:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to\Ncongratulate you on your win.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.63,0:13:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I even brought some pastries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.37,0:14:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, congrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.91,0:14:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were so awesome, Asada.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.35,0:14:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, Sinon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.37,0:14:07.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.67,0:14:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best gunner in GGO now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.13,0:14:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew all along you could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.69,0:14:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You deserve being number\None more than anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.03,0:14:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You showed them all what\Nreal strength's about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.67,0:14:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.27,0:14:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.55,0:14:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, Asada?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.29,0:14:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.61,0:14:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said, you said to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.29,0:14:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.71,0:14:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.07,0:14:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you told me to wait, and if\NI did, then you'd be mine. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.25,0:14:42.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I waited.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.51,0:14:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I waited for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.69,0:14:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.57,0:14:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on, I'll always be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.27,0:14:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need him to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.09,0:14:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.51,0:14:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna protect you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.33,0:14:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.61,0:15:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shinkawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.52,0:15:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.05,0:15:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.39,0:15:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Asahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.39,0:15:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Xenon. Mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.67,0:15:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.79,0:15:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you push me away like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.25,0:15:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.99,0:15:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We both did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.07,0:15:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shinkawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.33,0:15:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shinkawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.24,0:15:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shinkawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.17,0:15:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make any sudden moves, Asada.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.53,0:16:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The syringe I'm holding's got a drug in it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.59,0:16:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that'll paralyze your\Nmuscles in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.43,0:16:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before you know it, your lungs\Nwill stop thin your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.49,0:16:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Syringe?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.87,0:16:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe by injecting some\Nkind of drug or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.05,0:16:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.61,0:16:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is the family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.17,0:16:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promised my dad I'd go to med\Nschool, so it's a done deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.57,0:16:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stuck with it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.81,0:16:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.71,0:16:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the other Death Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.35,0:16:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.69,0:16:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You figured out Death Gun's little secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.75,0:16:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.99,0:16:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Death Gun's partner in crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.61,0:16:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up to now, before this year's B .O .B.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.89,0:16:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anyway, I was the one playing Sterben.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.21,0:16:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But today, I insisted on being\Nthe one to do the job IRL.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.11,0:16:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.15,0:16:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to be the one doing the deed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.11,0:16:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let some other guy touch\Nyou, even if that guy's my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.89,0:17:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.67,0:17:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then, the player who belonged\Nto that murder guild and SAO,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.79,0:17:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that was your older brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.39,0:17:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.85,0:17:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just you and me now, Asada.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.55,0:17:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.55,0:17:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.05,0:17:20.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.73,0:17:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about cram school, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.03,0:17:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you were going to be a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.65,0:17:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.56,0:17:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I'd give a damn about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.47,0:17:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about my parents, those guys in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.05,0:17:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all assholes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.67,0:17:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what would have made me happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.57,0:17:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be the strongest player in GGO.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.91,0:17:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that piece of shit Saxe lied\Nabout AGI types being the strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.55,0:17:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I fell for it like an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.71,0:17:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.67,0:17:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,GGO was everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.69,0:17:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I gave everything up in the\Nreal world for it, goddammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.55,0:18:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You killed Saxe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.47,0:18:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because he lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.35,0:18:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.75,0:18:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was the perfect victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.43,0:18:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had to show the world Death\NGun was the strongest in GGO.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.81,0:18:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In all the VR Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.49,0:18:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What better person to\Nsacrifice than that dork?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.87,0:18:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now that that's done, I\Ndon't need this reality anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.03,0:18:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's move on to the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.39,0:18:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, just you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.39,0:18:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.13,0:18:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can go somewhere like GGO.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.49,0:18:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.40,0:18:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someplace with a fantasy vibe instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.37,0:18:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as it's with you, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.87,0:18:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.11,0:18:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be husband and a wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.33,0:18:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get a house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.24,0:18:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll go on quests together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.79,0:18:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and have kids, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.75,0:18:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.81,0:18:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.21,0:18:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.65,0:18:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.56,0:18:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.95,0:18:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are more than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.93,0:18:56.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're mine and no one else's.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.31,0:18:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always loved you, Asuna. Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.43,0:19:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In school,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.49,0:19:03.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when I heard about what happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.17,0:19:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when I heard what you did,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.09,0:19:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could look all over and never\Nfind another girl like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.35,0:19:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you shot a real bad guy\Nwith a real gun and killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.29,0:19:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How cool is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.45,0:19:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.25,0:19:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said you had real power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.09,0:19:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I came up with the Death Gun Legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.09,0:19:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I picked the Type 54\Nas his gun because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.31,0:19:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how much I love you, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.19,0:19:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.63,0:19:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.47,0:19:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.15,0:20:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to see anything\Nor feel anything anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.45,0:20:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.93,0:20:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.83,0:20:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, you went to all that trouble\Nto save me, but it was all for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.87,0:20:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.39,0:20:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After we log out, I\Ncould head over to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.83,0:20:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he comes over, he'll be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.85,0:20:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I can't do anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.83,0:20:33.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.15,0:20:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up to this point, all we've been\Ndoing was looking out for ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.55,0:20:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We certainly never fought for anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.19,0:20:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now, even though it might be too late\Nfor us, let's go fight for someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.41,0:20:51.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just this once, me and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.19,0:21:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.11,0:21:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.35,0:21:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.26,0:21:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.25,0:21:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.16,0:21:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of me! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.35,0:21:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna! Asuna! Asuna! Asuna! Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.29,0:21:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.20,0:21:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run, Xenon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.91,0:22:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito...
