Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.15,0:22:53.78,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}If it will vanish one day
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.63,0:22:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be stronger and stronger,
